    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Poor appetite; tired; no fever or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No abdominal pain, dysphagia, or change in bowel habit</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No memory complaints, unsteadiness, or tremor</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood, loss of interest, early waking, and guilt about a lost friend; no suicidal thoughts; no elevated mood or racing thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

